# Note: dist/ is intentionally NOT ignored. It is committed so Cloudflare Pages
# serves the built bundle even when the dashboard build settings are missing.
# Once the dashboard has Build command="npm run build" and Output directory="dist",
# re-ignore dist/ here and stop committing it.

